rch has shown that factors such as vitamin D and calcium intake, as well as omega-3 fatty acids, can play a significant role in the risk of experiencing a myocardial infarction. Understanding these dietary impacts is essential for managing and potentially reducing the risk of this life-threatening event.", "NONVERTEBRAL FRACTURES:Nonvertebral fractures are injuries that occur outside the vertebral column and have been studied in relation to vitamin D supplementation.", "AMINO ACID SUPPLEMENTATION:Amino acid supplementation is a dietary intervention studied for its effects on muscle mass and function, particularly in older adults.", "PLANT STEROL-ENRICHED SPREAD:Plant sterol-enriched spread is a dietary product studied for its cholesterol-lowering potential.", "EUROPEAN COMMISSION:The European Commission is the executive branch of the European Union responsible for proposing legislation and implementing decisions, including those related to health and nutrition.", "BRUSSELS:Brussels is the capital city of Belgium and the de facto capital of the European Union, where many health and nutrition policies are discussed.", "CALCIUM SUPPLEMENTS:", "BERDANIER CD:Berdanier CD is the editor of the Handbook of Nutrition and Food, which includes contributions on nutrition for older adults.", "SOCIETY ESPAÑOLA DE GERIATRÍA Y GERONTOLOGÍA:The Spanish Society of Geriatrics and Gerontology focuses on the health and nutrition of older adults.", "IM&C:IM&C is a publishing house that has published works related to nutrition and health for the elderly.", "NUTRITIONAL RECOMMENDATIONS:NUTRITIONAL RECOMMENDATIONS are comprehensive guidelines designed to enhance overall health and well-being through informed dietary choices. These recommendations focus on improving cardiovascular health by advising individuals to limit added sugars and sodium intake. They are particularly aimed at older adults, helping to improve their dietary habits and nutritional intake. Additionally, these guidelines are based on evidence and are intended to prevent and treat obesity and overweight conditions. Developed by various organizations, NUTRITIONAL RECOMMENDATIONS promote health and aim to prevent diseases through a balanced and mindful approach to diet.", "NUTRITION CLINICAL DIET HOSP:Nutritional Clinical Diet Hospital is a publication that discusses dietary recommendations for geriatric patients."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}